# Who reviews changes to what.
#
# `AGENTS.md`'s `ASSIGNEE` is the same handle, so the branch naming, commit
# comments, and PR assignee all point at the same person.
#
# Requires "Allow this repository to assign pull requests to reviewers" in
# Settings -> General -> Pull Requests. Without it, GitHub silently ignores
# these rules and nothing is enforced.
#
# Format: <path-pattern>  <reviewer> [<reviewer> ...]
# Last matching pattern wins, so put broad rules first and specific ones last.

# Default: everything requires a review.
* @fiwon123

# The workflow itself: a change here affects every future change.
/.github/workflows/**   @fiwon123
/.opencode/**           @fiwon123
/scripts/**             @fiwon123
/Makefile               @fiwon123
